      "content": "but that's just what people say to feel better. i can't just \"be kind\" to myself when i know what i'm actually capable of. it's not like i was scared, i was just... indifferent. it feels like my moral compass is just totally dead. like i don't even belong in the same category as people who actually care about others.",
