      "content": "It is a terrible burden to carry the weight of a past mistake, but you are not irredeemable just because you once chose to look away. Many people feel exactly this way about their worst moments, and the very fact that you are questioning your worth proves you still have a conscience, not a hollow shell. You deserve to be given the chance to grow, even if it feels impossible right now.",
